            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiya wakamini hamu nawankakulula jindi, amujiikili mumukala waDavidi, mwanindi Asa hakumuswana. Hamafuku indi ituŋadamweneni zo-o nyaka ikumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa wadiŋi nanjita yawantu asenda nkebu namayoŋa, amuYuda makombakaji makulakaji asatu; amuBenjamini asenda nkebu, evulapa nimataanyikunji, makombakaji makulakaji ayedi namakombakaji makumi atanu nasatu: ejimawa adiŋi ayilobu akwaŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi wena hikukwinza kaEtiyopiya Zera nanjita yawantu makombakaji ikombakaji, nimakulakaji amakálu asatu. Hakwinza kuMaresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa hakuya nakumubulakana, hiyakutanjika njita muchinekineki chaZefwata kuMaresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa hakubilelakudi Yehova Nzambi yindi, nindi, Eyi hiwamonaŋ kukala kukwashahela akwaŋovu hela abula Ŋovuku; tukwashuku eyi Yehova Nzambi yetu, muloŋa tunashindameni hadeyi, chitunenzi nakulwa naluntu ilu, tunenzimwijina deyi. Eyi Yehova, yeyi Nzambi yetu; bayi akwimika mushindukudi muntu wafwapaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakutapa aEtiyopiya kwakuyayi Asa, nikwakuyawu aYuda; aEtiyopiya hiyakutemoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa nawantu adiŋiyi nawu hiyakuyikupisha kushika nikuGerari; aEtiyopiya hiyakudimboka amavulu nankashi chakukaŋanya nikudikolesha cheŋi; muloŋa wena achikekeli kumesu aYehova ni kumesu anjita yindi; hiyakusendaku yuma yabuwiluwu yayivulu nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atapa ninyikala yejima yadiŋi kwakwihi naGerari; muloŋa woma waYehova wayikwatili; hiyakupupa nyikaloyuyejima, muloŋa mwadiŋi yuma yayivulu nankashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atapa nimatenti ayimuna, asendaku ninyikoku yayivulu nankashi, nianŋameli, hiyakufunta kuYerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
